title: "KubeNDT: A Network Digital Twin platform in Kubernetes"
abstract: "KubeNDT is a platform for deploying and operating virtual network topologies on Kubernetes. Topologies are defined declaratively and materialized as Kubernetes-native resources, with a driver and capability system that applies the same network configuration actions regardless of the container image each node runs."
